            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 15:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keanyutu iinacan luka Yosep ebe atwana papakec, kobalas ebe, “Elemuni kilai Yosep oni, ka aitokokol da oni cut kanuka aronisio kere nukolo kiswamanakini oni ŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakikis Yosep, kobalas ebe, “Abu papakon kicorak eroko ketwana ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Awa 28:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Age 49:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Ilimokinete do Yosep ebe, Keŋaiŋait, kitim adiakaret naka ikoniinacan, ka aronisikec da, naarai apotu kesi kiswamakis jo nueroko.’ Natikwana da, kiŋaiŋait isio jo, kitim adiakaret naka ibulesin luka Edeke loka papakon.” Komony Yosep naeneratatar kaŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
